sequenceDiagram
    participant UE as UE Simulator
    participant AMF as AMF
    participant AUSF as AUSF
    participant UDM as UDM
    participant SMF as SMF
    participant UPF as UPF

    UE->>AMF: Attach Request (IMSI)
    AMF->>AUSF: Authenticate
    AUSF-->>AMF: Auth Token / Security Context
    AMF->>UDM: Fetch Subscriber Profile
    UDM-->>AMF: Allowed Slice / DNN Policy
    AMF->>SMF: Create PDU Session
    SMF->>UPF: Allocate User-Plane Anchor
    UPF-->>SMF: Forwarding Ready
    SMF-->>AMF: Session Context
    AMF-->>UE: Attach Accepted

    Note over UE,AMF: UE lifecycle: connected -> registered -> active session

    UE->>AMF: Release / Deactivate
    AMF->>SMF: Release Session
    SMF-->>AMF: Session Inactive
    AMF-->>UE: Released

    Note over UE,AMF: UE lifecycle: idle -> detached
